  "_readme_timetable": "Starting timetable per section: bell times (slots) and lessons per week per subject (lessons), from the school's 2026 block timetables. Loaded ONLY into a section with no bell times, and a grade with no lessons-per-week yet — later changes on Timetable → Setup are never overwritten. 'names' = the ways the subject may be spelled in Subjects (the first match is used). 'mustEndBy' = every lesson of that subject ends by this time (Maths before lunch). Lower Primary comes from the school's Term One 2026 lower timetable. PRE_SCHOOL_example is NOT loaded (Pre-School has no timetable for now); rename the key to PRE_SCHOOL to use it, or set times on Timetable → Setup.",
